    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt even feel like a \"discovery\" though. it feels like a void. i look at my notes and my data and i just see a waste of time. there's no purpose left in it. i used to think if i worked hard enough, i'd find something that actually meant something, but now i just feel like i'm staring into nothingness. and honestly? the nothingness feels more real than the work ever did.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
